   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 注释的分类\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1.单行注释\n",
    "\n",
    " 以#开头，#右边的所有东西当做说明，而不是真正要执行的程序，起辅助说明作用"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "6ed89176-49c8-41ab-aeba-3afd45322059",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "hello world\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# 我是注释，可以在里写一些功能说明之类的哦\n",
    "print('hello world')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e036a196-50ec-4f04-aed3-1f71a6a5f087",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.多行注释"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "id": "35c15d6c-547a-4074-86b7-68de3ed9d01f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "'\\n第一行\\n\\n第二行\\n'"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 11,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "    我是多行注释，可以写很多很多行的功能说明\n",
    "    \n",
    "    \n",
    "    哈哈哈。。。\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "'''\n",
    "第一行\n",
    "\n",
    "第二行\n",
    "'''"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "932cd295-6374-4355-821b-7b1c5ff81454",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "你好\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print('你好')"
   ]
